bside-trace 1
# Combined waveform bits e, alone in this trace (all oscillators reset by the test bit).
# Oscillator 3 (frequency 0x1d3b, pulse width 0x7f0) read through the read register;
# oscillator 1 (frequency 0x0c17, pulse width 0x300) plays the same bits: on one model a
# combination with the saw can pull its accumulator top bit low. With noise: the output writes back into the noise register (first 40000 cycles of noise alone at frequency 0xffff fill it), it may lock at 0; a test pulse recovers it.
